8489	Aside from the fact that the gravity boots are totally unnecessary for me (5'9 160) this is probably the single most beneficial purchase I have ever made, and is by far the MOST THERAPEUTIC tool I have ever found for my joke of a spinal cord.    Since some catastrophically poor chiropractic work following a car accident, my muscle imbalances that were present since childhood ran wild, pulling discs all over the place, leaving my spine with the integrity of a Lego building or perhaps a jigsaw puzzle.  If it weren't for an excellent chiropractic technique called NUCCA, which helped me recover to at least a manageable bad back (a considerable upswing from what I had which was nothing short of a living nightmare), I probably would have jumped off a bridge by now.  After trying about 800 million different things ranging from Diet & Nutrition, to Flexibility Training, to Alternative Medicine, I finally gave the inversion rack a shot.    This IS it for my condition.  I almost always hit a home run in popping my spine back in place at night on this thing and the last 6 weeks have been the best of the last 13 years for me.  I can't say I'm 100% because my back still gets all twisted up, but with the Teeter, I can get things straightened out before bed and I've noticed HUGE physical improvements.    I would say spinal health is the core of physical well being.  I can't see how a person could end up all hunched over as an elder person if they used this tool in the years leading up to retirement.  Given the discomfort I had in my TWENTIES, I can't imagine how awful it must be to have a bad back in one's latter years.  Inversion is absolutely amazing and is an improvement I think over the slant board which is something I wish I'd have done when I couldn't afford this rack.      You should definitely exercise caution in using this piece as many people are not meant to be hanging upside down by their ankles, especially without supervision.  The teether strap prevents full inversion however and I would advise using it at first.  Build up to full inversion.  Other than that-- THIS IS WORTH IT'S WEIGHT IN GOLD for me.      I hope this review helps you with your back problems if you have any.	\N	16	POSITIVE	5	17	\N	8489	132	\N	\N
