ink when I'm home alone I will use the Magnivisions. When I go out, I will leave those and take these 4Readers with me so friends, family and the world at large will think I am a cool guy and will not be wondering where John-Boy is.visions. When I go out, I will leave those and take these 4Readers with me so friends, family and the world at large will think I am a cool guy and will not be wondering where John-Boy is.	\N	6	POSITIVE	4	6	\N	737	132	\N	\N
