lue color with gray accents for the trunk and ears. I was surprised at first that the nose points upward and thought that looked funny, but I'm used to it now.<br /><br />Overall, I couldn't ask for a better child-sized mask at this price.prised at first that the nose points upward and thought that looked funny, but I'm used to it now.    Overall, I couldn't ask for a better child-sized mask at this price.	\N	0	POSITIVE	5	0	\N	1265	132	\N	\N
