up would havemeant a couple of wipes across it. Instead I had to clean in all the little crevices marked out by those spirals -- spirals that didn't even bring anything to the table.<br /><br />As much as it pains me to slam my first, I must. I wouldn't recommend this one. My biggest issue is the lack of a suction cup, and the squishiness of it. Maybe if it were stiffer, then it would go in easier and be a funner toy. All things being equal, now that I have the Tantus Buck, I'll probably never use the bandito again.	\N	0	NEUTRAL	3	0	\N	2063	132	\N	\N
