2231	The is a really cute cool-mist ultrasonic humidifier. I was one of the lucky ones and mine arrived in perfect quiet working condition.<br /><br />However for those new to cool mist humidifiers here are a few tips/notes:<br /><br />1) These 1-gallon units run approximately 8hrs set on high. Enough for a full night's sleep.<br /><br />2) They should be whisper quiet, except for the occassional water bubble. If there is any loud humming or machine noises, your unit is defective and needs to be returned/exchanged.<br /><br />3) Most ultrasonic cool-mist humidifiers require removal of the water tank for refilling. The difference is in the size and shape. These cute ones have a rounded shape and can be slippery and awkward.<br /><br />4) Be careful of dropping the humidifier, this will cause the humifier to hum loudly. These ultrasonic are quite fragile in that way.<br /><br />5) Inspect the O-ring each year and make sure it is securely in place. Any leaking is usually caused by a faulty O-ring or a badly seated O-ring. This is especially important after being taken out of storage as the O-ring may have dried out and cracked over the summer. Replacement generic O-rings are easy to find at your local hardware store or online.<br /><br />6) The ultrasonic nature of these machines (all ultrasonic humidifiers) encourage mineral buildup and sometimes that can compromise the teflon coating of the base panel. Extra care should be taken during cleaning. This happens to all ultrasonic humifiers and not only to Crane brand ones.<br /><br />I have owned several ultrasonic humifiers over the years and prefer their whisper quiet operation over all other humidifiers. However, there seems to be a high percentage of duds when buying these, so be prepared to return/exchange until you get a good one. The sizes range from travel-sized to 2-4 gallon tanks that can be left on without refilling days at a time.<br /><br />Overall I would reccomend this as an economical, smaller and cuter alternative to the huge beige versions.ative to the huge beige versions.	\N	26	POSITIVE	4	32	\N	2231	132	\N	\N
