m and more.<br /><br />4. Easy to use and convenient access to all controls.No need to lift hands, results in natural feel while using product.<br /><br />As a daily user of this product for the past ten years, it's truly a huge benefit for those with low vision.or the past ten years, it's truly a huge benefit for those with low vision.	\N	27	NEGATIVE	1	32	\N	4501	132	\N	\N
