5707	These energy strips are no joke.  They work fast and they are very strong.  Three strips equal about the same energy as a Monster or Liquid Energy from Vital 4 U.  There are 24 per pocket sized pack.  That's like 8 energy beverages for just over two bucks.  The best part is, unlike energy beverages you can really control your dosage.  If you are a light weight you can have just one.  You can have four if you want a little extra kick instead of leaving two thirds of a can of energy soda getting flat.  <br /> <br />They are not as thin as mouthwash strips.  They are sort of like thin bandaids and the same beige color.  They stick the first spot they touch in your mouth but start to dissolve quickly.  The flavor is similar to an Altoid but not as stong, with a slightly bitter flavor.  If you're a fan of energy blends, you won't mind at all.  If you've never had energy drinks you might not enjoy this flavor.  I like it because I know that taste means sweet surges of power are on the way.   <br /> <br />I don't recommend keeping them in your pocket.  They tend to stick together if I do.  Once the first few are gone and the stack of strips is below the little plastic edge of the case, they crack and break easily as you try to get them out.  You have to be careful if you want the strips out whole but it's easy to tap them out instead of reaching in with your fingertip and trying to slide them out as they break. <br /> <br />So the only drawbacks besides the container they come in is a taste that's not perfect.  I love to wash these strips down with a CL-ONE, Monster Assault, or Sobe Adrenaline rush and a hot cup of coffee that has a Liquid Energy Scream pouch stirred into it.  I find the synergistic effect of several energy formulas combined increase the potency and duration of my energy trip. <br /> <br />	\N	1	POSITIVE	5	1	\N	5707	132	\N	\N
