e or wipe free.    While the plastic may seem cheap and the fingers may seem flimsy, they've held up to daily use for two months now.  The wand is fairly easy to keep clean as well - there is a hole in it to run hot water through.    Initially, I had a little trouble snapping two of the pieces together, but after five or so uses, the problem went away, so play with snapping the pieces together a few times first.    And be patient...  It's worth it.	\N	64	POSITIVE	4	64	\N	8101	132	\N	\N
