8404	By adding additional weight to activities such as walking, running and working out on cardio machines you are quickly able to increase the effort expended and therefore the results.  Wearing the vest is also an excellent way to increase the effectiveness of ab routines because the weight is already on your body rather than having to hold a dumbbell or weight plate.<br /><br />The X2 vest is relatively comfortable to use and is able to fit body types of all sizes.  You put it on by lifting it up and sliding your head through the opening at the top.  It is secured by flexible straps that stretch across your sides from the back of the vest to the front.  These are held in place with velcro so it is easy to strap in and take off.<br /><br />This version of the vest can hold up to 20 lbs of weight, but only 12 lbs are included.  These weights are a set of 1 lb. lead tubes that fit in slots within secured pockets on both the front and back of the vest.  This makes it so that you can vary the amount of weight you are using up to the maximum.  Other versions of the vest can hold much more weight.<br /><br />My only complaints about this product are that I thought I was ordering the vest with the 20 lbs of weight included (because of how they had it displayed at that time) and if you wear the vest for an extended period of time with too much weight, you will be sore in the areas between your neck and shoulders (where the top of the vest sits).<br /><br />From what I can see, they have corrected the first issue and now specifically state that it only includes the 12 lbs.  Although it is possible to order additional weight later on, it will cost you more to do so.  However, saving the money in order to make sure that you really like and will use the vest would be a good reason to stick with the lower cost alternative.<br /><br />As for the second issue, if your want to avoid this soreness you should only start with approximately 5% of your body weight and wear it for only an hour or so at a given time.  Over time, you can build from there to more usage and higher weight.  Or, you can just accept that you will be sore in that area the next day but it is not something that will cause any actual damage to your body.<br /><br />Overall, I think this is a great product and will probably be purchasing the more advanced 40 lb version at some point in the future.ime, you can build from there to more usage and higher weight.  Or, you can just accept that you will be sore in that area the next day but it is not something that will cause any actual damage to your body.    Overall, I think this is a great product and will probably be purchasing the more advanced 40 lb version at some point in the future.	\N	1	POSITIVE	4	1	\N	8404	132	\N	\N
