ds and that can diagnose a proper rhythm.  For people that are looking for Tachy rhythms it is great, and it will for sure identify wide QRS complex conditions and will show other things that are good to know for most people.<br /><br />  I am absolutly impressed that this little machine does what it does. It has its place for sure.  (As of 6-21-09 I do not mean this - It is a toy)ythm.  For people that are looking for Tachy rhythms it is great, and it will for sure identify wide QRS complex conditions and will show other things that are good to know for most people.       I am absolutly impressed that this little machine does what it does. It has its place for sure.  (As of 6-21-09 I do not mean this - It is a toy)	\N	3	POSITIVE	4	5	\N	8551	132	\N	\N
