r /><br />For those of you more knowledgeable about electronics, you might surmise that the wattage should gradually increase over time.  Not really.  There were continuous fluctuations of about 2-3% but no upward trend over a five minute period.<br /><br />Despite the false advertising with the reported capabilities, I am happy with the product.  One interesting feature is the intense power of the fan. I used my Windlinq anemometer to measure the exhaust speed (cold) from the hair dryer with its widest attachment.  It registered an amazing 58 mph!/> <br />For those of you more knowledgeable about electronics, you might surmise that the wattage should gradually increase over time.  Not really.  There were continuous fluctuations of about 2-3% but no upward trend over a five minute period.   <br /> <br />Despite the false advertising with the reported capabilities, I am happy with the product.  One interesting feature is the intense power of the fan. I used my Windlinq anemometer to measure the exhaust speed (cold) from the hair dryer with its widest attachment.  It registered an amazing 58 mph! <br />	\N	1	POSITIVE	4	2	\N	9769	132	\N	\N
