12004	Pros: This fountain is beautiful! It produces a swirling mist infused with colors and a soft, soothing trickling noise. There are no distracting mechanical whirring or grinding noises. One of the best features is a water level sensor that automatically shuts it off when the water falls below a certain level. It eases my mind considerably to know it won't be damaged if I forget to turn it off! It is surprisingly easy to assemble despite the initially daunting number of pieces to put together. The mist it creates is pretty, and a decorative towel placed underneath the unit helps soak up the water drop condensation around the base.<br /><br />Cons: When first assembling the fountain, the length of the \\\\"Troubleshooting\\\\" section seemed ominous. As it turns out, when used frequently the fountain requires a lot of careful maintenance. The bowl and metal parts accumulate slimy scum and buildup that is difficult to remove. The buildup interferes with the function so it must be cleaned often. After hand scrubbing with an old toothbrush was ineffective, I eventually found running the washable parts through the dishwasher with vinegar worked well. It is a pain to take apart and reassemble so the cleanings are an irritation.<br /><br />Aside from cleaning, there are other issues as well. Surprisingly - since fountains are of course filled with water - the suction cups inside shrivel permanently after only a few weeks of immersion. So my fountain's inner parts are currently balanced rather precariously on non-functioning crooked rubber. After several months of use, both the mist and the colors now function erratically. Sometimes the colors falter or don't come on at all and the mist occasionally stops misting. Cleaning, reassembling and jiggling various parts sometimes help - but not always. Frustratingly, they occasionally start working again for what seems to be no reason at all. And last but not least, though the fountain is supposed to work well with adding essential oils for a lovely smell, I found the oils quickly cause a dirty, slimy cloudy fountain.<br /><br />Overall: Despite the trials and tribulations of trying to keep the fountain clean, I still enjoy the lovely trickling sound, the wonderful mist and the pretty colors. I don't use it as frequently now as when I first got it because of the cleaning difficulties, but I still enjoy it when I do use it. I hope the company improves on this design and releases a more robust model in the future.for a lovely smell, I found the oils quickly cause a dirty, slimy cloudy fountain. <br /> <br />Overall: Despite the trials and tribulations of trying to keep the fountain clean, I still enjoy the lovely trickling sound, the wonderful mist and the pretty colors. I don't use it as frequently now as when I first got it because of the cleaning difficulties, but I still enjoy it when I do use it. I hope the company improves on this design and releases a more robust model in the future.	\N	52	NEUTRAL	3	52	\N	12004	132	\N	\N
