eeps its charge for at least that long.<br /><br />SPEED<br /><br />Unlike Intelliclean, Essence only has one speed. That's all that's necessary for my kids. When there are multiple speeds, the kids play around with it instead of brushing their teeth.<br /><br />IN SUMMARY<br /><br />For a good, basic sonic toothbrush, choose Essence. Its simple, no frills design is especially suitable for children.peed. That's all that's necessary for my kids. When there are multiple speeds, the kids play around with it instead of brushing their teeth.     IN SUMMARY     For a good, basic sonic toothbrush, choose Essence. Its simple, no frills design is especially suitable for children.	\N	0	POSITIVE	5	0	\N	13224	132	\N	\N
