hiznit, but after trying Panasonic I won't be switching back.  These got their game down to a science.  I've been using it in the shower for over a month now, literally every single day and not only is it performing flawlessly, I have no razor burn or irritiation like with those other models.  I highly, highly recommend this shaver if you, like me, have one of those tough beards that regular shavers can't get through, or that blades just pull and hurt while shaving.  This is literally, the only electric I've ever owned that lives up to what it claims.	\N	10	POSITIVE	5	10	\N	15784	132	\N	\N
