16940	This is an 1800 watt hair dryer, with 3 heat selections, 2 speeds, and a cool shot button which really should be called a cold shot.  Attachments include a diffuser and a concentrator. I can't comment on the concentrator because it's not an attachment I use. One of these days I may try it for a straightening blowout. The cool shot button is not a press and hold like other dryers I've had, it's an on/off, and other than feeling the cold air coming out, you can't visibly tell whether it's on or off. With cool shot off, the \\\\"Cool\\\\" setting is rather cool. Some have commented it's quieter than other dryers, and it may be, but for me it's not. The last one I had was a Conair which I think could've been a \\\\"quiet\\\\" model, and I'd say it's comparable to that one. I'm not sure it's possible to make a really quiet, powerful, 1800 watt hair dryer, but this one is not too loud.     My hair is wavy to curly, a little thicker than average, and somewhat coarse but not very, it actually varies in texture - I can find some hairs that are very coarse and curly, others that feel almost fine and straighter. See my pics in the image gallery for what my hair actually looks like, and dried with this hair dryer.    I start off on High heat/High fan speed, with the diffuser, and am able to dry my hair in under 10 mins, towards the end decreasing to Warm/Low. I decided to try drying my hair from absolute soaking wet, with a little gel, and it was dry in 10 mins. With the normal towel drying to get the excess water out - 5-7 mins. And the best part I didn't feel like I was burning my scalp or my hair, was able to use the High/High setting longer, and never started sweating from all the heat I normally get from a dryer.     I was one of those a little reluctant to spend more than the $20-$25 I usually spend on a dryer, but when my last Conair died, and my \\\\"backup\\\\" hair dryer left my hair in a frizz, I started shopping on here. The reviews convinced me to try this more expensive but still affordable hair dryer, and I am so very glad I did! I only regret I didn't look for this sooner!	\N	6	POSITIVE	5	6	\N	16940	132	\N	\N
