17557	Does an excellent job, the power (speed) is user adjustable, and the attachment bits are well made and should last a very long time.  Two cautions.  The first two I received stopped working due to an overheated motor which burned out.  The manufacturer was cooperative about replacement, and the third one has now been working for nearly a year.  If you get this product, I would suggest you use it frequently and for long sessions during the first 30 days in case you also receive a defective one which needs to be replaced.  The second caution:  it removes calluses in fine particles which spray around the room and looks like baby powder sprinkled everywhere. To minimize this \\\\"dust\\\\" I use the machine in the bathtub (dry) while sitting on a stool, with the shower curtain closed, and with the bathroom door closed.  About 90% of the \\\\"skin dust\\\\" remains within the bathtub and can be showered down the drain.  This advice about the \\\\"skin dust\\\\" also applies to the Artemis Heel Smoother, which works more slowly and eats up even the most expensive batteries. The Medicool is faster and is plug-in electric, but costs 5 times as much as the Artemis. The Artemis requires purchase of replacement filing tips and batteries, but is lighter weight and easier in the hand, and more portable.	\N	9	POSITIVE	5	9	\N	17557	132	\N	\N
17558	Do you ever want to eliminate odors in the sick room or in the bathroom? Well, here is the solution, Medi-Aire Biological Odor Eliminator.  With only one spray, fresh air enters the space.  I have used many products but never found anything that works as well as this one. I promise that if you use this product you will never use anything else.	\N	1	POSITIVE	5	1	\N	17558	132	\N	\N
